# Only CVE records (CVE-json/), the web explorer (index.html, index.json, stats.json),
# source code (faultline/, tests/, config/, update.sh, .github/) and README are tracked.
# Everything under data/ is local operational state (discovery queues, refresh
# provenance, HTTP cache); CI keeps it in an actions/cache entry, never in git.
.DS_Store
*.tmp
__pycache__/
data/
docs/superpowers/
